  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1410.03 Calculation of 24-Hour De Minimis Emission Level",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1410.03 Calculation of 24-Hour De Minimis Emission Level. To calculate the 24-hour de minimis emission level for an RTAP in pounds per day, the 24-hour AAL shall be divided by 84.17.\n\nSource. #8278, eff 2-4-05 (from Env-A 1411.03); ss by #9601, eff 11-25-09; ss by #12443, eff 1-5-18; ss by #13334, eff 2-3-22",
